                        vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 643</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1945v01#pg_650">650</ref>; <ref target="frus1945v02#pg_398"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >ii</hi>, pp. 398</ref>–<ref target="frus1945v02#pg_399">399</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus1945v02#pg_1495">1495</ref>, <ref target="frus1945v02#pg_1511"
                        >1511</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
